    "description": "Nike India is actively seeking a talented and motivated E-commerce Executive to join our dynamic team in Madurai. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Nike India:\nNike India is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Track key performance indicators including GMV, conversion rate, and ROI\n• Coordinate with vendors and suppliers for inventory management\n• Create engaging content for product pages and social media\n• Develop and implement category growth strategies\n• Monitor and improve Net Promoter Score (NPS) and customer satisfaction\n• Analyze sales data and customer behavior to drive revenue growth\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Magento\n• Proficiency in CRM Software\n• Proficiency in A/B Testing\n• Proficiency in Retention Marketing\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Digital Marketing\n• Proficiency in Customer Segmentation\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Nike India!",
